{"id":"msg_m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_mast","label":"Mast · Nikke"},"label":"6. Today was a long day for both of us, Master Ca…","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_02","next":null,"speakers":{"mast_m":"Mast"},"icons":{"mast_m":"si_c354_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_1","text":"Today was a long day for both of us, Master Captain.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_2","text":"Would you like to eat first, or have a bath?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_3","text":"Both are services which I can provide.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_4","text":"Although, having said that...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_5","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_5","text":"??","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_6","text":"Could it be that","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_7","text":"you want to choose me?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_8","text":"I, Mast, the most daring pirate maid who sailed the high seas?!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_9","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_9","text":"I'm pretty hungry, so I'll eat first.","jump":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_12"},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_10","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_10","text":"I should clean up a bit.","jump":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_17"},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_11","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_11","text":"I'd like to spend time with you.","jump":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_22"},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_12","text":"You chose food over me?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_13","text":"How hungry can you possibly be?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_14","text":"Of course, I'll tend to you either way, but...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_15","text":"If you pick spending time with me, isn't it safe to assume food automatically comes with that?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_16","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_16","text":"Haha, all right. I'll hang out with you.","jump":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_23"},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_17","text":"I appreciate that,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_18","text":"but why don't you think it over one more time?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_19","text":"If you pick me, it won't be a one-time thing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_20","text":"You'll be signing up for continuous service in the future!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_21","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_21","text":"Haha, all right. I'll hang out with you.","jump":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_23"},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_22","text":"I appreciate your frankness!","jump":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_23"},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_23","text":"For being such a wonderful shipmate,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_24","text":"I'll be givin' you all three as a reward, arr!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_25","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_25","text":"Haha.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_26","text":"You're a lucky landlubber, Captain.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_27","text":"You've got a superlative pirate maid like me","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_28","text":"feeding you, washing you,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_29","text":"and even...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_30","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_30","text":"Even what?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_31","text":"...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_32","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_32","text":"What were you about to say?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_33","text":"Er... nothing!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_34","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_34","text":"Come on, what is it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_35","text":"*Sigh*... You really are quite the character.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_36","text":"Do I really have to say it out loud?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_37","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_37","text":"I'd like to hear it directly from you, yes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_38","text":"Hm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_39","text":"Well...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_40","text":"I could even...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_41","text":"give you a kiss.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_42","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_42","text":"I'd like that.","jump":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_44"},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_43","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_43","text":"...","jump":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_54"},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_44","text":"Uh...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_45","text":"This may be a little strange,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_46","text":"especially when I'm the one who brought it up,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_47","text":"but are you sure that","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_48","text":"a kiss is enough?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_49","text":"After all this time","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_50","text":"we've been spending together,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_51","text":"I'm not sure if that'll be sufficient.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_52","text":"I know, I know that this sounds totally bizarre.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_53","text":"But don't you agree with me?","jump":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_60"},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_54","text":"?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_55","text":"I offer you a kiss, and that's the reaction I get?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_56","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_56","text":"It's just that I think I'll need more to be satisfied.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_57","text":"If that's the case,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_58","text":"you decide","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_59","text":"what happens next.","jump":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_60"},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_60","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_60","text":"We'll both decide at the moment.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_61","text":"Got ti.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_62","text":"Got it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_63","text":"Uh...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_64","text":"I'll be in my room.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"mast_m","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mast_romanticmaid_03_65","text":"Come as quickly as you can.","jump":null}],"chat":true}